PLACEHOLDER-DO-NOT-USE
# This file documents where the checkpoint-signing Ed25519 key (ADR-000019)
# lives. Do not use this value and do not copy this file to
# checkpoint_signing_key.txt. Generate a real keypair with the collector's own
# subcommand (never hand-write this file — the private key line must be exact):
#   docker compose run --rm collector checkpoint genkey \
#     > secrets/checkpoint_signing_key.txt
#   chmod 600 secrets/checkpoint_signing_key.txt
# The public verifier key is printed to stderr — publish it (it is what third
# parties use to verify signed checkpoints) but never commit the private key.
# Rotating the key starts a new, independently-verifiable checkpoint lineage;
# there is no in-place rotation.
